{"3528930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SPACESHEEP", "steam_appid": 3528930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/61ac029eadb45f9464d0e0c1da71f751.avif?t=1762857793\" width=609 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship may be busted, but that’s not stopping you! Travel through bizarre alien planets, each with its own dangers, weird creatures, and strange landscapes. Who knows what secrets (or trouble) you’ll find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/44dd56c892c80383a79060861c106478.poster.avif?t=1762857793\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/44dd56c892c80383a79060861c106478.webm?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/44dd56c892c80383a79060861c106478.mp4?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/5669ffd1809fa99a01e6c0ed299f44e4.avif?t=1762857793\" width=609 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in space? Bring a buddy along! Play solo or with a friend in <strong>2-player co-op</strong> and work together to solve challenges, escape enemies, and (hopefully) not get lost in space forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/aa2d66843799be146a1aad4584998ce7.poster.avif?t=1762857793\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/aa2d66843799be146a1aad4584998ce7.webm?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/aa2d66843799be146a1aad4584998ce7.mp4?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/722dcbc0b35a5163e3da4ac9211ca100.avif?t=1762857793\" width=609 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything in space wants to be your friend. Some creatures and aliens are out to stop you—stomp, dodge, and outsmart them to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/bc36e5f442f2247ac79b5c49d51e8180.poster.avif?t=1762857793\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/bc36e5f442f2247ac79b5c49d51e8180.webm?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/bc36e5f442f2247ac79b5c49d51e8180.mp4?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/14daee6db8ebfcf0153223dd2376d0bb.avif?t=1762857793\" width=609 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family of fellow sheep is waiting for you back on planet earth! Jump, fight, and parkour your way through unknown worlds as you inch closer to home. Do you have what it takes to make it back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/71e2a63fea1931403a633ea5f9bba9c1.poster.avif?t=1762857793\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/71e2a63fea1931403a633ea5f9bba9c1.webm?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/71e2a63fea1931403a633ea5f9bba9c1.mp4?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A small project with big dreams!</strong> <i>SPACESHEEP</i> started as a school project, but thanks to our love for games (and a lot of late-night coding), it made its way to Steam. Your support means the world!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/61ac029eadb45f9464d0e0c1da71f751.avif?t=1762857793\" width=609 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship may be busted, but that’s not stopping you! Travel through bizarre alien planets, each with its own dangers, weird creatures, and strange landscapes. Who knows what secrets (or trouble) you’ll find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/44dd56c892c80383a79060861c106478.poster.avif?t=1762857793\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/44dd56c892c80383a79060861c106478.webm?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/44dd56c892c80383a79060861c106478.mp4?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/5669ffd1809fa99a01e6c0ed299f44e4.avif?t=1762857793\" width=609 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in space? Bring a buddy along! Play solo or with a friend in <strong>2-player co-op</strong> and work together to solve challenges, escape enemies, and (hopefully) not get lost in space forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/aa2d66843799be146a1aad4584998ce7.poster.avif?t=1762857793\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/aa2d66843799be146a1aad4584998ce7.webm?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/aa2d66843799be146a1aad4584998ce7.mp4?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/722dcbc0b35a5163e3da4ac9211ca100.avif?t=1762857793\" width=609 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything in space wants to be your friend. Some creatures and aliens are out to stop you—stomp, dodge, and outsmart them to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/bc36e5f442f2247ac79b5c49d51e8180.poster.avif?t=1762857793\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/bc36e5f442f2247ac79b5c49d51e8180.webm?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/bc36e5f442f2247ac79b5c49d51e8180.mp4?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/14daee6db8ebfcf0153223dd2376d0bb.avif?t=1762857793\" width=609 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family of fellow sheep is waiting for you back on planet earth! Jump, fight, and parkour your way through unknown worlds as you inch closer to home. Do you have what it takes to make it back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/71e2a63fea1931403a633ea5f9bba9c1.poster.avif?t=1762857793\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/71e2a63fea1931403a633ea5f9bba9c1.webm?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528930/extras/71e2a63fea1931403a633ea5f9bba9c1.mp4?t=1762857793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A small project with big dreams!</strong> <i>SPACESHEEP</i> started as a school project, but thanks to our love for games (and a lot of late-night coding), it made its way to Steam. Your support means the world!</p>", "short_description": "You are a brave sheep who was sent to space by the USSR to test a new spaceship, but it veered off course and crashed on an alien planet! You must travel across strange worlds and fend off enemies to make it back to Earth safe